        <p class="hp-deck__kicker">AI workflows for teams of any size, anywhere</p>
        <h1 class="hp-deck__title" id="s1">Your team types all day. <em>(Let AI do the typing)</em></h1>
        <div class="hp-deck__low">
          <span class="hp-deck__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8600;</span>
          <p class="hp-deck__tag"><b>Start with the Inbox Assistant: ready in 3 business days, and you only pay if it saves your team 5 hours a week.</b></p>
          <p class="hp-lead">Emails, WhatsApps, invoices, quotes, calls: AI drafts the work, a person checks it.</p>
