    <!-- Slide 2: the problem -->
    <section class="hp-slide hp-problem" id="problem" aria-labelledby="s2">
      <div class="hp-wrap hp-problem__grid">
        <div>
          <p class="hp-num">01</p>
          <p class="hp-label">The problem</p>
          <h2 id="s2">Small tasks. Whole days.</h2>
          <p class="hp-problem__lead">None of it is hard; it just fills the day. It&rsquo;s different in every business: missed calls, invoices typed in twice, quotes that never get followed up, the same question for the tenth time today, and yes, the inbox.</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="hp-art hp-art--problem hp-pile" data-anim aria-label="The kind of work that piles up: missed calls, invoices to capture, quotes waiting, repeated questions and unread emails.">
          <img src="assets/art/inbox-overload.webp?v=3" alt="" width="800" height="533" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="hp-chip hp-chip--1"><b>&#9742; 6 missed calls</b><small>since 17:00 yesterday</small></span>
          <span class="hp-chip hp-chip--2"><b>14 invoices to capture</b><small>typed into Xero by hand</small></span>
          <span class="hp-chip hp-chip--3"><b>Quote sent 9 days ago</b><small>no follow-up yet</small></span>
          <span class="hp-chip hp-chip--4"><b>&ldquo;What are your hours?&rdquo;</b><small>asked 11 times this week</small></span>
          <span class="hp-chip hp-chip--5"><b>Meeting notes</b><small>still not written up</small></span>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Slide 3: how it works, for any kind of work -->
    <section class="hp-slide hp-flow" aria-labelledby="s3">
      <div class="hp-wrap">
        <p class="hp-num">02</p>
        <p class="hp-label">How it works</p>
        <h2 id="s3">Built around your work.</h2>
        <p class="hp-flow__lead">Not another app to learn. A workflow that fits how you already work.</p>
        <ol class="hp-steps">
          <li><span class="hp-step__ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="36" cy="12" r="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="24" cy="36" r="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M17 12h14M15 16l6 15M33 16l-6 15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><b>We map the work</b><span>What comes in, who handles it, how long it takes today</span></li>
          <li><span class="hp-step__ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><rect x="5" y="8" width="14" height="10" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="29" y="19" width="14" height="10" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="5" y="30" width="14" height="10" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M19 13h5v22h-5M24 24h5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><b>We build the workflow</b><span>Connected to the tools you already use</span></li>
          <li><span class="hp-step__ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path d="M24 9c-4-4-12-2-12 5-5 1-6 8-2 11-3 5 1 11 7 10 1 4 5 5 7 3V9Zm0 0c4-4 12-2 12 5 5 1 6 8 2 11 3 5-1 11-7 10-1 4-5 5-7 3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M24 16h-5M24 24h-7M24 31h-4M24 20h6M24 28h7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><b>AI does the routine part</b><span>A person checks anything that matters</span></li>
          <li><span class="hp-step__ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><circle cx="24" cy="26" r="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M24 26V16M20 5h8M24 5v5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><b>You see the time saved</b><span>Timed before and after, the same way</span></li>
        </ol>
