    <!-- Slide 6: why us -->
    <section class="hp-slide hp-who" aria-labelledby="s6">
      <div class="hp-wrap hp-who__grid">
        <figure class="hp-art hp-art--tall hp-rise" data-anim><img src="assets/art/reach-up.webp?v=2" alt="" width="533" height="800" loading="lazy" /></figure>
        <div>
          <p class="hp-num">05</p>
          <h2 id="s6">Honest about AI.</h2>
          <p>Most of the AI we&rsquo;re asked to build shouldn&rsquo;t be built. So we time the work first, and if it isn&rsquo;t worth it, we say so before you spend a rand.</p>
          <ol class="hp-promises">
            <li><b>Works with what you already use.</b> Like Gmail, Outlook, WhatsApp and Xero. No new software for your staff to learn.</li>
            <li><b>Your data stays yours.</b> It stays in your accounts, isn&rsquo;t used to train AI, and is handled under POPIA.</li>
            <li><b>No lock-in.</b> You own the accounts, the system and the data, documented so any developer could take over.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

